The first glmark2-es2 run on the NanoPC-T6 (Mali-G610, panthor, back end gpu-mali, #20) from main `@SHA8@` (kernel 6.18.55-current-rockchip64, the tools/mali/panthor-gles pair, libGLESv2.so.2 sha256 `@PAIR16@`), one glmark2-es2 process per scene at 800x600 on an EGL pbuffer, gives verdict hang in 1 scene(s): `[terrain] <default>`.

